        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Walking Dead, The Walking Dead season 7, \"Say Yes\"\n- Companies: AMC\n- Concepts: television episodes, television seasons, post-apocalyptic horror television series\n\nFacts:\n- The seventh season of The Walking Dead premiered on AMC on October 23, 2016.\n- The seventh season of The Walking Dead consisted of 16 episodes and concluded on April 2, 2017.\n- \"Say Yes\" aired on AMC on March 5, 2017.\n- \"Say Yes\" was the twelfth episode of The Walking Dead season 7 and the 95th episode overall of The Walking Dead.\n- The Walking Dead is an American post-apocalyptic horror television series.",
